5. Add error checking and recovery mechanisms to handle network failures, file access errors, and other potential issues.
6. Consider using existing libraries for these functionalities instead of implementing them from scratch. For example, there are many mature logging libraries available in C that can be used. 

Please note, this is just a basic start and it doesn't contain all the functionality you might require. It's a starting point to which you could add more features as per your requirements.
']

