}
```
This code is a simplified version. The fetchFSAData function in particular could be more robust and could handle different types of errors, including timeout issues. This would involve implementing additional error checking around the curl_easy_perform call and using libcurl's multi interface for asynchronous requests. Furthermore, proper handling of memory allocation should also be added to ensure no leaks even in failure scenarios.
