Then we can create a producer consumer pattern with backpressure and buffering:

```java
public class EventProcessor {
    private BlockingQueue<Event> queue = new LinkedBlockingQueue<>(1000); // Configurable buffer size

    public void produce(Event event) throws InterruptedException {
        queue.put(event);
    }

    public void consume() throws InterruptedException {
        while (true) {
            Event event = queue.take();
            process(event);
        }
    }
}
```
